      },
      "text": "Iberá Nature Reserve"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:highlight_text:c91aa1b93e49cc23",
      "field": "highlight.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "2ff6a80500304bd20deffac95b798aa4c4085ad839b67a91ca6593a6a8b96b7d",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-ddf5eabec8e2",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "The lagoons, marshes and floating islands of vegetation in Iberá make up one of north-eastern Argentina’s most distinctive ecosystems. You may see capybaras, caimans, many kinds of birds and a variety of aquatic plants. You’ll spend several days at the lodge, with excursions into the surrounding natural areas."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:71984452f525cd9d",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ad9b5d9d0cce661a86a9226565489ce0ea9805bfe48b72af7483e6a95d877ea5",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-ddf5eabec8e2",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Three capybaras in the grass beside a lagoon in Iberá Nature Reserve, Argentina"
    },
    {
