        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Buenos Aires"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a4836cca1208c95",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0e91bf86dea55548a6e1e033438905d860c3e02c015935e5f593ab21fb4e6089",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-ddf5eabec8e2",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "On arrival at Buenos Aires airport, you’ll be met and taken to your hotel.\n\nLater that day, a 4-hour sightseeing tour takes you through the Argentine capital. Buenos Aires brings together European architecture, broad streets, green parks and South American city life. The city has many restaurants, cafés and shops, as well as museums displaying classical and contemporary art, including works by Rubens and El Greco.\n\nOn the tour, you’ll see the memorial obelisk and walk through La Boca and San Telmo. At Plaza Dorrego, you can browse antiques. The route then takes you to Plaza de Mayo and the Casa Rosada, the famous Pink House. Your guide will share the city’s history and tell you about Evita Perón.\n\nAfter the tour, return to your hotel.\n\n**Tour duration:** 4 hours."
    },
